# .vercelignore — files Vercel CLI shouldn't upload on `vercel deploy`.
# Complements .gitignore; anything in .gitignore is already excluded.
#
# This repo has ~1 GB of dev-only data in /data (SQLite DB, event dumps,
# coord backups, enrichment log) and /.cache (Mapbox geocoding cache)
# that's useful locally but not needed by the runtime. Without this
# file `vercel deploy` hits the 100 MB per-file limit on data/events.db
# and the 250 MB total-deploy limit.
#
# Build-time reads from /data:
#   - data/gemeinden-registry/  (gemeinde-hub pages)
#   - data/festival-overrides.json  (imported by FestivalHubClient,
#     festival-image-scraper, get-landing-festivals — three source modules
#     `import overridesJson from '../../../data/festival-overrides.json'`).
#     Without the whitelist, Vercel builds fail with "Module not found".

# Entire data dir except the few files we need at build time
data/*
!data/gemeinden-registry
!data/gemeinden-registry/**
!data/festival-overrides.json

# Local Mapbox / Nominatim geocode caches — dev-only
.cache/

# Claude Code working directory
.claude/

# Flow-next task tracker
.flow/

# Local reports + archives
Bericht*.txt
